WEBVTT

00:00:28.066 --> 00:00:31.611
I despise fitting
into the lane or the mold

00:00:31.611 --> 00:00:34.280
that this question insinuates.

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:36.032
But I reluctantly say, “Yes.”

00:00:36.908 --> 00:00:39.410
I am a two-time NCAA champion.

00:00:39.452 --> 00:00:40.703
(Cheers)

00:00:40.745 --> 00:00:44.123
(Applause)

00:00:44.165 --> 00:00:45.416
Thank you.

00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:47.877
A two-time gold medalist
and a two-time --

00:00:47.919 --> 00:00:49.712
(Applause)

00:00:49.754 --> 00:00:51.589
A two-time WNBA champion.

00:00:51.631 --> 00:00:52.965
(Cheers)

00:00:53.007 --> 00:00:55.968
But inside I scream, "I am so much more."

00:00:56.677 --> 00:01:02.433
(Applause)